{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18590","headline":"巽上人以竹闲自采新茶见赠酬之以诗 · 柳宗元","name":"巽上人以竹闲自采新茶见赠酬之以诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳丛翳湘竹，零露凝清华。\n复此雪山客，晨朝掇灵芽。\n蒸烟俯石濑，咫尺凌丹崖。\n圆方丽奇色，圭璧无纤瑕。\n呼儿爨金鼎，余馥延幽遐。\n涤虑发真照，还源荡昏邪。\n犹同甘露饭，佛事薰毗耶。\n咄此蓬瀛侣，无乃贵流霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}